  "contract": [
    "Null frame returns -1. Clear56-byte input,64-byte result and disjoint local arrays. Pack signed accelerometer, low frame-counter byte, sleep byte, chip1 and24 bits; unique pointer remains NULL.",
    "Read12 sparse channel-map entries at3+i+(i&~3);255 disables. Driver is unsigned sum of AGC bytes16 and8, gain is low nibble and enable bits descend within each byte. No previous-gain state writes.",
    "Accept core statuses0,3,4; others return -5. Only result flag exactly1 publishes. Preserve signed int32 to float32 conversion then float32 division by10000 before existing round helper.",
    "Publish rounded SpO2,R,confidence,valid level,HB mean,invalid flag and duplicate first result; mask255/count8. Reload live output pointers as stock does. Disabled native report is a real BX LR."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Core computation, diagnostics and logging are modeled in comparisons. All five frame adapters and selected memory/sleep/popcount/round helpers execute actual C/native bodies. Physical sampling, concurrency and final executable startup/placement remain unverified.",
    "Round helper validation covers this adapter finite signed32 /10000 domain under all four active FPSCR modes, including status bits. This does not admit arbitrary NaN, infinity, overflow or the whole general helper contract. Cold physical FPU behavior remains unverified.",
    "4433 comparisons comprise1044 direct and3389 dispatcher cases; some integrated cases gate or fault before SpO2. Direct cases include81 matching selected faults. Both fixtures execute380 new native bytes and74 reused round-helper bytes.",
    "899 units compile and compose;888 prior nongenerated sources/objects are unchanged. Import set replaces aggregate SpO2 executor with unfinished computation core, remaining78 application/22 boot. Relocatable composition is not a bootable image."
  ],
